      "content": "stop trying... that's what i'm saying. but it's more than just giving up on a cause. it's like, i look at everything and just don't see any reason to actually exist in it. if the world is just this cycle of corruption and misery, why am i even stuck in the middle of it? it feels like there's no real way to escape the heaviness unless you just... stop being a part of it entirely.",
